    {
      "id": 250224,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-01-03T16:27:25.139Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I did not, in fact, think they would go a week without posting something! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> And this is a very fun idea to post!</p>\n<p>Tilling the fields?! XD And I love that Christopher doesn’t want to do it.</p>\n<p>Dude, Victor Borge! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"> If you have never heard of him, you need to change that now, he was fantastic.</p>\n<p>Can totally envision Adam doing the Numa Numa dance.</p>\n<p>There really needs to be one card in DE, maybe in Guise’s deck or Wager Master’s, where Christopher draws the art.</p>\n<p>What a lovely little outro. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2023-01-03T16:27:25.139Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 26,
      "readers_count": 25,
      "score": 35.2,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 29804,
      "topic_slug": "rejectsode-2023",
      "display_username": "KateWalker",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
