      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "I did not, in fact, think they would go a week without posting something! :) And this is a very fun idea to post!\n\nTilling the fields?! XD And I love that Christopher doesn't want to do it.\n\nDude, Victor Borge! :O If you have never heard of him, you need to change that now, he was fantastic.\n\nCan totally envision Adam doing the Numa Numa dance.\n\nThere really needs to be one card in DE, maybe in Guise's deck or Wager Master's, where Christopher draws the art.\n\nWhat a lovely little outro. :)",
