      "id": 250229,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-01-03T21:58:53.269Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was cringing at their whole opening shtick about how something terrible was going to happen between when they recorded it and when it was released.  In light of Darren Watts’s passing, I thought it was in kind of poor taste that Trevor released it as-is.  I suppose there’s a sense in which it makes sense for a blooper episode, but it turned out to be really unfunny.</p>",
