      "created_at": "2026-01-20T16:24:24.595Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Telling a knock knock joke is like learning to fly in the universe if Douglas Adams.  You have to make an earnest attempt at hitting your target, failing through no fault of your own, in order to succeed at doing the highly improbable.</p>\n<p>Oh hey, Gruum cameo in one of the last clips.</p>",
